# Deny-by-default build context (audit SEC-10).
# The image build COPYs exactly one file from this repo: docker/entrypoint.sh.
# Source code, .env, .git, logs, and data are bind-mounted at runtime and must
# never enter the build context. If a future Dockerfile COPYs more, add
# explicit !exceptions below — never delete the leading "*".
*
!docker/Dockerfile
!docker/entrypoint.sh
